			`	"Our thanks to thee for setting the sensors, Captain. We saw their first reports only shortly after thy own craft jumped away, and nothing since. We shall remain as watchful as we ought to be. For thine efforts, Seineq's credited thee the agreed payment of <payment>. If thou wishest for further, join us at the port here tonight for another task."`
