mission "Successors: Ghosts Seineq Attacked"
	invisible
	landing
	source
		attributes successor
		not attributes uninhabited quiet
		not planet "Shassa-Wyra-Orrou"
	to offer
		has "event: successors: ghosts seineq attacked"
	on offer
		event "successors: ghosts seineq memorial" 50
		conversation
			`As you disembark into this planet's spaceport, you can feel a new and heightened tension in the air. In an unsettling mirror of the immediate aftermath of the attack on Kaatrij's base, the Successors here all stand crowded around the spaceport's screens, watching as news comes in of a second attack. This time, however, the image shown on the displays is one you recognize: it's the base on Shassa-Wyra-Orrou from which you worked with House Seineq.`
			`	"...reports, yet confirmed, that several ships were seen, soonafter retreating under veil of cloak," the reporter on the displays says. "Much suspicion now falls to noble House Kaatrij for using such technol'gies in the past, ones they once had sworn they left behind."`
			`	The Successors around the screen murmur and slither around each other. As the broadcast goes on and the crowd grows and the first casualty numbers begin to come in, the overlapping translated speech in your ears starts to smear together; you find yourself stumbling against a wall in the spaceport, only able to get up once you've momentarily plucked the translation device from your jacket.`
				decline



