				has "Successors: Ghosts: discreet"

			`	"A shame," your interrogator says, making a motion with one of their arms; behind them, one of the guards raises their rifle. Instinctively, you go to grab your own sidearm, only to remember that it was taken from you minutes ago just as the guard's railgun round pierces your body.`
				die

			label "was discreet"
			`	Your interrogator regards you thoughtfully for a moment. "Consider thy choice carefully, Captain," they say. "Among us, there is little way forward for a 'free agent,' as thou namest it. An offer such as this one shall not come again."`
			choice
				`	"All right, then, if it's the only way forward for me."`
					goto yes
				`	"No, I've made my decision. I won't join you."`

			action
				set "successors free agent" # This doesn't do anything now, but if Ghosts is ever expanded to let the player character ally with other Houses, this tag would be useful to have.
			`	"A shame," the Successor says. "But so long as thou dost not give up what thou hast learned or otherwise make thyself an enemy of this House, Kaatrij shall not impede thee." They pause and their skin blossoms with intense color. "Do not make us regret this leniency."`
			`	They gesture towards the door and the guards move to the side, allowing you to leave. As you walk back to your ship, the Seiitej takes off, leaving you alone but free.`
